# One line per identity GitHub cannot link to an account, or that its owner
# chose to list. The build takes each contributor's GitHub login from the
# canonical <login>@users.noreply.github.com address and, for any other
# address, asks GitHub which account it belongs to (github_account in
# kit/scripts/build.py). So a contributor's address needs no line here and
# none is added for them. Bots and agents are co-authors in commit trailers,
# never authors, and never appear on the site.
Aaron Bell <air@users.noreply.github.com> air <aaron.bell@gmail.com>
